<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Medical Resources started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Medical Resources started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dillon, Read said analysts James Lane and Shahreen Islam initiated coverage of Medical Resources Inc with a buy rating and a 12-to-18-month price target of $14.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/16 at 7-13/16.</p>
</text>
